Each project evaluation follows this workflow:

1. Clone the source in ~/projects
2. Write a harness at ./examples/<project> that wires up the project's controllers to kamera
3. Do initial web research to learn about the project and the types of workloads it supports
4. Smoke test the harness with a simple scenario
5. Start looking for bugs using established skills:
   a) dependency-analysis
   b) scenario-design
   c) scenario-exploration

Artifacts:
- Findings and analysis go in examples/<project>/.agents/ANALYSIS.md
- Traces supporting any bugs found go in examples/<project>/.agents/evidence/
